        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86693, Industrial Chic Jasper Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Jasper Door Handle is a great choice for modern decors. Its sleek and clean design pairs beautifully with the available contemporary finishes. Choose from 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths for your wood, metal, and fiberglass interior and exterior doors. This Jasper Door Pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to mount it on doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/jasper-back-to-back-handle-pair-emtek-btb-86693\"><b>Jasper Pulls with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Jasper Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-DP86693-specifications.pdf?v=1704262400\"><b>Emtek Jasper Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86693:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86694:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
